+
+title: Qualcomm Khaje Global Clock & Reset Controller
+
+maintainers:
+  - Taniya Das <quic_tdas@quicinc.com>
+
+description: |
+  Qualcomm Khaje global clock controller provides clocks, resets, and voltage
+  corner votes for the SM6225 platform.
+
+  See also: include/dt-bindings/clock/qcom,gcc-khaje.h
+
